PQClean
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The ML-KEM (FIPS 203) and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) reference implementations in
Sources/CryptoPQC, together with the FIPS 202 (Keccak) and SHA-2 code in
Sources/CryptoPQC/common, are taken from PQClean:

    https://github.com/PQClean/PQClean

These files are released into the public domain under CC0 1.0:

    https://creativecommons.org/share-your-work/public-domain/cc0/

Per-scheme LICENSE files are retained alongside the sources they cover. The
Keccak and SHA-2 implementations are public-domain code whose original authors
are credited in comments at the top of the respective files:

  * common/fips202.c derives from the public-domain crypto_hash/keccakc512/simple
    implementation by Ronny Van Keer, and from the public-domain "TweetFips202"
    implementation by Gilles Van Assche, Daniel J. Bernstein, and Peter Schwabe.

  * common/sha2.c derives from the public-domain crypto_hash/sha512/ref
    implementation by D. J. Bernstein.

