NIST ACVP test vectors
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Tests/CryptoPQTests/Vectors/acvp.json contains a subset of the ML-KEM and ML-DSA
known-answer vectors published by NIST in the ACVP server repository:

    https://github.com/usnistgov/ACVP-Server

This material was prepared by employees of the U.S. National Institute of
Standards and Technology and is not subject to copyright protection in the
United States.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
X-Wing test vectors
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Tests/CryptoPQTests/Vectors/xwing.json contains the Appendix C test vectors from
draft-connolly-cfrg-xwing-kem-10:

    https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-connolly-cfrg-xwing-kem

